description: Use-case orchestration rules for end-to-end pipeline flows
globs: src/pipeline/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Pipeline Orchestration Rules

- Keep orchestration as application/use-case logic, not infrastructure-heavy code.
- Compose scraper, transform, and load via dependency injection.
- Define clear stage boundaries and explicit handoff contracts between stages.
- Handle partial failures with explicit stage-level error reporting.
- Prefer structured logs that identify stage, dataset, and failure reason.

# Pipeline Tests

- Test stage order and stage interaction contracts.
- Test fail-fast behavior and error propagation across stages.
